            "detailed_description": "<strong>Overview:</strong><br>&quot;Sanctuary VR&quot; is a first-person puzzle solving and exploration game designed for Oculus Rift, it has a strong narrative that is fully voice acted. <br>The game is a seated VR experience played with a controller. <br><br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br>A group of refugees fled the war on earth for a new home aboard a creaking old star-ship named the &quot;Korolev&quot;, but they never arrived at their destination. <br>You venture into deep space alone searching for the &quot;Korolev&quot; and the loved one who never arrived. <br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br>Believable and interesting puzzles (no key hunting, or page finding) <br>Unique setting, the &quot;Korolev&quot; is a unique ship worth exploring. <br>Strong narrative that is fully voice acted - Replay audio logs anytime while exploring, no need to stare at a menu while you listen.<br><br><strong>Non-VR version:</strong><br>A non-VR version is now included in the main package, simply select the option to play the non-VR version when prompted at startup.",
